AMZN Consumer Cyclical 200.7000 218.9400 revenue 213386000000 net income 21192000000;
GOOGL Communication Services 171.6777 300.8800 revenue 113829000000 net income 34455000000;
JNJ Healthcare 161.3349 239.6300 revenue 24564000000 net income 5116000000;
JPM Financial Services 241.5863 293.5500 revenue 45796000000 net income 13025000000;
XOM Energy 104.0451 150.7600 revenue 80039000000 net income 6501000000.
The portal data could not be retrieved because the granted browser was unavailable, so leave Benchmark_Return_Pct, Analyst_Rating, and Target_Price blank rather than inventing data; make Alpha and Upside_Pct blank-aware formulas that remain blank if inputs are absent. Performance columns exactly: Symbol, Sector, Price_1Y_Ago, Current_Price, Return_Pct, Benchmark_Return_Pct, Alpha, Analyst_Rating, Target_Price, Upside_Pct. Rows exact order. Round displayed/computed values to two decimals; prefer native formulas for Return_Pct, Alpha, Upside_Pct. Financials columns exactly: Symbol, Revenue_Latest_Q, Net_Income_Latest_Q, Profit_Margin_Pct; divide raw values by 1m and use formulas for margin. Summary simple labels in A and values in B, rows exactly Best_Performer, Worst_Performer, Avg_Alpha, Stocks_Above_Benchmark, Stocks_Below_Benchmark. Use formulas; make alpha summary blank-aware (Avg_Alpha blank if no alphas; counts can be 0). Apply professional formatting, freeze panes if supported, sensible widths, number formats, tables optional. Verify workbook contents after creation and report path and key ranges.
Build Excel dashboard
